flowchart TB
  subgraph Architecture
    UI[React UI] --> API[tRPC API]
    API --> ORM[Drizzle ORM]
    ORM --> DB[(MySQL/TiDB)]
  end
  subgraph CRUD
    C[Create form] --> V[Zod validation]
    V --> I[Insert row]
    I --> R[Read list]
    R --> U[Update row]
    U --> D[Delete row]
    D --> A[Audit log]
  end
  subgraph Admission
    P[Patient] --> B{Available bed?}
    B -->|Yes| AD[Create admission + occupy bed]
    B -->|No| E[Return clear error]
    AD --> DC[Discharge workflow]
    DC --> AV[Release bed + update patient]
  end
  subgraph Appointment
    S[Select doctor/time] --> CF{Conflict within 30 minutes?}
    CF -->|No| SC[Save scheduled appointment]
    CF -->|Yes| CE[Return conflict error]
  end
